<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adviser Williams sentenced on insider trading.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adviser Williams sentenced on insider trading.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Securities Commission (ASC) said corporate relations consultant Murray Williams was sentenced on Friday to 18 months periodic detention and fined A$50,000.</p>
<p>The corporate watchdog said this is the first insider trading case successfully prosecuted by the ASC.</p>
<p>It said a court had found Williams purchased shares in pay television operator Australis Media Ltd while in the possession of information which was not generally available.  </p>
<p>Williams was a corporate relations consultant retained by Australis when he purchased 200,000 Australis shares in November 1993.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
